# ===== Descriptions (hover hint) =====
desc_char_select => Pick which character file to edit. The list is built from data/characterList.txt plus every characters/*.json found in loaded mods.
desc_image => The image/sprite sheet file used by this character (e.g. characters/BOYFRIEND). Reload Image re-reads it from disk.
desc_reload_image => Re-read the current image file from disk and rebuild all animations. Useful after editing the sprite sheet outside the editor.
desc_health_icon => The health icon shown on the health bar in gameplay (e.g. bf, dad, gf).
desc_get_icon_color => Sample the dominant color of the health icon and write it into the health bar RGB values.
desc_vocals => Optional postfix for the character's vocal track file. Leave empty to use the default vocal file.
desc_anim_select => Pick an animation to edit its name, symbol/tag, framerate, loop flag and offsets.
desc_anim_name => The animation name that appears in gameplay logic (e.g. singLEFT). Must match what the game requests.
desc_anim_symbol => The sprite tag/prefix inside the sprite sheet for this animation (e.g. BF NOTE LEFT0), or the symbol name for Animate atlases.
desc_anim_fps => Playback speed of the animation in frames per second.
desc_anim_loop => Whether the animation loops forever or plays once and stays on the last frame.
desc_anim_indices => ADVANCED: comma-separated list of specific frames to use for this animation. Leave empty to use the whole symbol.
desc_anim_add_update => Add a new animation with the values above, or update the existing one with the same name. Offsets are kept on update.
desc_anim_remove => Delete the animation whose name is currently in the Animation Name field.
desc_playable => Whether this character is controlled by the player (BF side) or the opponent (Dad side). Toggles flip and position presets.
desc_flip_x => Mirrors the character sprite horizontally. Stored as flip_x in the JSON.
desc_no_aa => Disable antialiasing for this character (pixel-art style). Stored as no_antialiasing.
desc_scale => Global scale multiplier applied to the character sprite.
desc_sing_duration => How long (in beats) the character keeps the singing pose after a note before returning to idle.
desc_healthbar_colors => Health bar color, saved as healthbar_colors in the character JSON (each 0-255). R = red component, G = green component, B = blue component. Controls the color of the health bar and the health icon - or use "Get Icon Color" in the Character menu to sample it from the icon automatically.
desc_pos_x => Stage position X offset added on top of the default opponent/player spot.
desc_pos_y => Stage position Y offset added on top of the default opponent/player spot.
desc_cam_x => Camera follow X position relative to the character.
desc_cam_y => Camera follow Y position relative to the character.
desc_make_ghost => Freeze a copy of the current animation frame as a ghost overlay, so you can compare poses while editing offsets.
desc_highlight_ghost => Add a red tint offset to the ghost so it stands out from the real character.
desc_ghost_alpha => Opacity of the ghost overlay (0 = invisible, 1 = fully opaque).
desc_save => Write the current character data to a JSON file (opens the system save dialog).
desc_load_template => Replace everything with the default BF template (idle + 4 sing animations) to start over.
desc_reload_char => Reload the current character from its JSON file, discarding unsaved changes.
desc_help_camera => Camera controls.
desc_help_cam_zoom => Zoom the camera in/out.
desc_help_cam_move => Pan the camera around the stage.
desc_help_cam_reset => Reset camera zoom back to 1x.
desc_help_char => Character controls.
desc_help_char_anim => Switch between animations.
desc_help_char_offset => Nudge the current animation's offset.
desc_help_char_offset_keys => Ctrl+C copy, Ctrl+V paste, Ctrl+R reset, Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Y redo the current offset; Ctrl+S saves the character.
desc_help_char_replay => Replay the current animation from frame 0.
desc_help_char_frame => Step through animation frames.
desc_help_other => Other controls.
desc_help_other_sil => Show/hide the stage silhouettes.
desc_help_other_shift => Speed up offset and camera movement.
desc_help_other_ctrl => Slow down camera movement.
desc_help_other_help => Toggle this help screen.
desc_help_other_exit => Leave the character editor.
